{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2023-05-22 11:00:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK ANNOUNCES 2023 INVESTOR DAY TO BE HELD ON JUNE 14TH, 2023', 'text': "NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL HOST AN INVESTOR DAY ON WEDNESDAY, JUNE 14TH, 2023, FROM APPROXIMATELY 8:00AM TO 1:00PM EDT. A LIVE VIDEO WEBCAST AND RELATED PRESENTATION MATERIALS WILL BE AVAILABLE TO ALL INTERESTED PARTIES THROUGH BLACKROCK'S WEBSITE, WWW.BLACKROCK.COM. FOR THOSE UNABLE TO JOIN THE LIVE WEBCAST, A REPLAY WILL BE AVAILABLE ON THE WEBSITE FOLLOWING THE EVENT. ANY QUESTIONS REGARDING BLACKROCK'S 2023 INVESTOR DAY MAY BE ADDRESS."}